  "description": "Click here and download the Kawaii Back to School PNG Bundle graphic · Window, Mac, Linux · Last updated 2026 · Commercial licence included ✓",
  "fullDescription": "Revamp your back-to-school season with our delightful ‘Cute & Playful Back to School Lettering Bundle’! This top-tier, heartwarming kawaii clipart set showcases twelve distinctive typographic creations adorned with cheerful pencils, joyful erasers, vibrant toy blocks, interactive chalkboards, and whimsical stars. It is the perfect companion to bring a dash of joy and color to your scholarly crafts and children’s clothing!\n\nOur ready-to-print designs are expertly devised for diverse uses such as sublimation, direct-to-garment printing, heat transfer, and day-to-day crafting projects. They work wonders on children’s and teachers’ apparel such as t-shirts and hoodies, add a playful touch to mugs and tumblers, and are great for tote bags and backpacks. They can also be used for customized planner stickers and scrapbooking, to liven up classroom décor and welcome back signs, and to make your greeting cards and invitations stand out.\n\nHere’s what the pack includes:\n• Twelve top-quality PNG files (each saved individually)\n• Transparent background that blends flawlessly with any color base\n• A high resolution of 300 DPI, offering sharp and distinct prints\n\nPlease note that this is a digital download product, and no physical item will be dispatched. Enjoy crafting with these designs and may your new school year be filled with joy and creativity!",
